Disconnected and laid out &quot;bolt on&quot; discharge head complete with XO assy, ESP pump, protector assy and motor c/w down hole gauge and multisensor.
Rigged down handling equipment and cleared/cleaned the rig floor.
Installed the wear bushing at 21,9 m.</witsml:sum24Hr><witsml:forecast24Hr>RIH to 890 m with DP to circulate a soap pill for cleaning the casing.
