Rig up for wireline logging and run a USIT-CBL log to verify cement quality behind 13-3/8&quot; casing.</witsml:forecast24Hr><witsml:ropCurrent uom="m/h">-999.99</witsml:ropCurrent><witsml:tightWell>0</witsml:tightWell><witsml:hpht>0</witsml:hpht><witsml:fixedRig>false</witsml:fixedRig></witsml:statusInfo>
