ents></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-25T03:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-25T04:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">806</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- completion string</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Changed to 7 5/8&quot; handling equipment. Installed PS30 slips.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-25T04:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-25T06:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">760</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- completion string</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH to 746 m and LD 7 5/8&quot; tubing.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-25T06:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-25T07:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">746</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- completion string</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Spliced rope to cable and fed same through banana sheave and back to cable spooler.Prepared DP pub and swedge.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-25T07:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-25T07:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">746</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Had TBT prior to making up DP pup and swedge to the tubing string. Made up swedge to 7-5/8&quot; tubing string.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-25T07:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-25T09:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">746</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Attempted to break circulation, but got minimal/no flow. Continued to pressure up tubing to 67 bar. Observed no pressure drop indicating plugged tubing. Suspect pump to be plug with debris. Bled off pressure and rigged down swedge.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-25T09:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-25T19:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">138</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- completion string</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Held TBT prior to continue pulling 7-5/8&quot; tubing. Pulled 7-5/8&quot; tubing wet from 746 m to 138 m. Disconnected cable clamps and spooled power cable back to the spooling unit.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-25T19:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-25T19:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">138</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- completion string</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Held tool box talk with crew</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-25T19:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-25T20:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">21</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- completion string</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Pull out of hole laying 7-5/8&quot; out tubing. Pulling wet. 
Recovered a total of 67 clamps - none left in the hole. 
The muddy solid filled tubing fluid was gradually becoming thicker and finally became solid just above the pump.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-25T20:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-25T20:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">21</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Held tool box talk with crew</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-25T20:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-25T21:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">21</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Cleared rig floor. Removed PS30 auto slipsand installed master bushing. Removed HTS power roller form rig floor.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-25T21:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-25T23:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">18</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Laid out last tubing joint. Pulled out ESP assemblies and removed clamps, power cable and instrument line to multi sensor. Disconnected power cable from motor.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-25T23:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-25T23:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state